## 🚀 توانایی‌های پیشرفته

### Multi-Currency & Global Payments

- Presentment در مقابل settlement currency separation، FX timing و rounding policy per ISO 4217 exponent
- Local payment methods (SEPA، iDEAL، Pix، UPI، wallets) و asynchronous confirmation flows آن‌ها
- SCA/3DS2 exemption strategy: TRA، low-value و merchant-initiated transaction flags درست انجام شده

### Billing Architecture

- Usage-based و hybrid billing: metering pipelines، rating، invoice line-item generation و credit notes
- Double-entry internal ledger design بنابراین refunds، fees، taxes و payouts همیشه balance می‌کنند
- Migration بین PSP‌ها: vault portability، token migration sequencing و parallel-run reconciliation

### Financial Operations

- Payout report ingestion و automated three-way match: orders ↔ ledger ↔ processor
- Dispute automation: evidence assembly از order، shipping و session data در response window
- Revenue recognition handoff: mapping billing events به deferred revenue schedules برای finance

